        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVa3FWcTS0I54NLhSc5cu85_mNXfLP-fzAwteZnZyLluwST3Ub9=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 weeks ago",
        "text": "Looking for an attentive, relaxing, satisfying massage …she is amazing. Excellent service with a lot of personal touches …love the socks!  She customizes  the  massage to your needs.",
        "time": 1769906977,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Michele Laplante",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104899588933732651083/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWvgOk2I5Yvjzd8Gk5Ihqsq4e7E--Ikhhx_mw-1VDp_z3qv3mA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "I had such an amazing experience with Sandra. I have had many massages in life and I was extremely satisfied with the massage I received. I give her a 10/10 ⭐️\nDid I also mention than she can do mobile massages as well so if you’re thinking of a nice gift for a loved one then I highly suggest surprising them with a massage. #1 Gift 🎁",
        "time": 1749044087,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "reema badhan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115530597918074920316/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJNq4o4iqF9xZKhZfCUKxJDfye5MDmpifazxRL_9Ks64G6ldQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "in the last week",
        "text": "I had an amazing experience with Sandra. From the moment I walked in, she made me feel welcomed, comfortable, and completely at ease. She took the time to listen to my concerns and made sure the session was tailored to exactly what I needed.\nThe massage was absolutely exceptional — the perfect balance of pressure, technique, and care. I could feel my stress melting away, and all my tension was handled with incredible skill.\nI left feeling relaxed, refreshed, and pain-free. Sandra is truly talented at what she does, and I highly recommend her to anyone looking for a healing and professional massage experience. I will definitely be coming back!",
        "time": 1771292262,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Chantale Morin",
